      "change": "Worker checks abort before and after adapter execution. Parent measures a monotonic deadline from child creation and rejects late exits; additional 10 seconds is cleanup grace only.",
      "regression": "timeout followed by a late normal adapter return cannot pass; harness rejects a valid-shaped result returned after adapter timeout"
    },
    {
      "issueId": "VER-03",
      "questionIds": [
        "CORE-21-C03"
      ],
      "status": "implemented-awaiting-independent-review",
      "files": [
        "validation/acceptance.mjs",
        "validation/run-gate.mjs",
        "validation/evidence.schema.json",
        "validation/acceptance-selftest.mjs"
      ],
      "change": "Require architecture/package-manifest.json and rerun verifyPackage without refresh. Bind each gate to packageManifestSha256; reject invalid, changed or refreshed packages when gate identity is stale.",
      "regression": "current/nonempty/canonical manifest, changed package, refreshed package invalidates old gates, mutation during gate, positive gate identity"
    },
    {
      "issueId": "VER-04",
      "questionIds": [
        "CORE-21-C04"
      ],
      "status": "implemented-awaiting-independent-review",
      "files": [
        "validation/acceptance.mjs",
        "validation/evidence.schema.json",
        "validation/acceptance-selftest.mjs"
      ],
      "change": "Provider call counts must be positive safe integers; heldoutSeedCount must be a safe integer >=3. Schema permits nonnegative measured counts for nonpassed/nonlive reports and adds positive/min3 conditions for passed live/holdout gates.",
      "regression": "string, fraction, boolean, null, zero, negative and unsafe integer counts"
    },
    {
      "issueId": "CROSS-VER-TIMEOUT-LIMIT",
      "discoveredBy": "/root/final_cross_review",
      "questionIds": [
        "CORE-21-C09"
      ],
      "status": "implemented-awaiting-independent-review",
      "files": [
        "validation/harness.mjs",
        "validation/selftest.mjs",
        "validation/README.md"
      ],
      "change": "harness accepts only safe integer timeoutMs in1..21600000 with default900000; run-gate already enforced the same upper bound. Document child-scope timing and no CLI override.",
      "regression": "unsupported timeout rejects before file reads or child creation, including2^31 and MAX_SAFE_INTEGER"
    },
